  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fOh3/3",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: start;\">이 수행평가를 진행하면서 제일 노가다 작업이 학생 시뮬레이션 깃허브 개별 업로드였는데</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">정운기 선생님이 자동화하는 법을 알려주셔서 개선해보았습니다</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><hr data-ke-style=\"style2\"><p style=\"text-align: start;\">정운기 선생님의 자료를 바탕으로 Claude로 수정 요청해 만든 것입니다</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">선생님 감사합니다!</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/sci_w_t/224253628448\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/sci_w_t/224253628448</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"과학의 날, 학생들이 AI로 앱을 만들다 (템플릿 공유)\" data-og-description=\"과학의 날, 학생들이 AI로 앱을 만들다 &#8212; 무료 웹앱 템플릿 공유 &#8212; 올해 과학의 날, 학생들에게 &quot;...\" data-og-host=\"blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/sci_w_t/224253628448\" data-og-url=\"https://blog.naver.com/sci_w_t/224253628448\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dF4IUI/dJMb9efq06c/PxIwU4QKYT09zdbK4kqmg1/img.png?width=743&amp;height=392&amp;face=0_0_743_392\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/sci_w_t/224253628448\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/sci_w_t/224253628448\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dF4IUI/dJMb9efq06c/PxIwU4QKYT09zdbK4kqmg1/img.png?width=743&amp;height=392&amp;face=0_0_743_392\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">과학의 날, 학생들이 AI로 앱을 만들다 (템플릿 공유)</p><p class=\"og-desc\">과학의 날, 학생들이 AI로 앱을 만들다 &#8212; 무료 웹앱 템플릿 공유 &#8212; 올해 과학의 날, 학생들에게 &quot;...</p><p class=\"og-host\">blog.naver.com</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><hr data-ke-style=\"style2\"><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">(활용 안내 역시 정운기 선생님 자료 기반입니다)</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">순서대로 따라해주시면 되겠습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">■ 1단계: 스프레드시트 만들기</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f1bfa796ad7ea065fbf3bb7a5d3484f87121d86_re_1784690507433\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3f1bfa796ad7ea065fbf3bb7a5d3484f87121d86_re_1784690507433\" data-origin-width=\"1860\" data-origin-height=\"712\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" data-ke-list-type=\"disc\"><li>sheets.google.com 접속</li><li>[빈 스프레드시트] 만들기</li></ul><p style=\"text-align: start;\">여기서 주소창을 클릭하시면</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ae66c37488b1d027945da12a0424d4617a92248_re_1784690507433\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ae66c37488b1d027945da12a0424d4617a92248_re_1784690507433\" data-origin-width=\"766\" data-origin-height=\"42\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">밑줄 친&#160;<b>d/와 edit사이</b>가 스프레드시트ID입니다. 이를 복사해놓습니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">■ 2단계: 코드 붙여넣기</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">이 스프레드 시트에서 그대로</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">[확장 프로그램]&#160; -&gt; [Apps Script]를 클릭합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3d53ac8d0a1f362090491e25718c877b50f5e55b_re_1784690507433\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3d53ac8d0a1f362090491e25718c877b50f5e55b_re_1784690507433\" data-origin-width=\"700\" data-origin-height=\"226\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c8758061694f7b86df1422b41119f7bfa5741efd_re_1784690507434\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c8758061694f7b86df1422b41119f7bfa5741efd_re_1784690507434\" data-origin-width=\"1802\" data-origin-height=\"358\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Code.gs에 해당하는 화면에 나온 것을 다 지워줍니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">(Ctrl+A -&gt; Delete)</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e8367d2e18c19445fb3e1d94067326e8ca8b05a?download\" data-file-name=\"Code_template.gs\" data-file-size=\"5887\" data-mimetype=\"\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfOh3%26dataid%3D3%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20260722134737&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F6e8367d2e18c19445fb3e1d94067326e8ca8b05a')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">Code_template</span><span class=\"type\">.gs</span></div><div class=\"size\">5.75KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">그리고 이 파일을 다운받아 사용합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">메모장에서 편집을 누르고, 전체 복사를 합니다. (Ctrl+A -&gt; Ctrl+C)</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d30e980623659cb74039f3d43992a81b304fa66_re_1784690507434\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d30e980623659cb74039f3d43992a81b304fa66_re_1784690507434\" data-origin-width=\"408\" data-origin-height=\"115\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2a882fb656906d5c06b56699cde21159841a82a3_re_1784690507435\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2a882fb656906d5c06b56699cde21159841a82a3_re_1784690507435\" data-origin-width=\"595\" data-origin-height=\"743\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">그리고 해당 내용을 Code.gs에 그대로 붙여넣기합니다. (Ctrl+V)</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6219e02a9718c100edce966a9d5e608005b3627c_re_1784690507435\" data-origin-width=\"944\" data-origin-height=\"488\" style=\"width:50.00%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6219e02a9718c100edce966a9d5e608005b3627c_re_1784690507435\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/798a91be08d9f14cad30eff1dac7e5ff4a6beb1b_re_1784690507435\" data-origin-width=\"1118\" data-origin-height=\"578\" style=\"width:50.00%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/798a91be08d9f14cad30eff1dac7e5ff4a6beb1b_re_1784690507435\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">여기서 이제 중요한 것이 위로 스크롤해서</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/506bd3eeebfb38b0fb43231c60d59c0546384935_re_1784690507435\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/506bd3eeebfb38b0fb43231c60d59c0546384935_re_1784690507435\" data-origin-width=\"641\" data-origin-height=\"246\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ae66c37488b1d027945da12a0424d4617a92248_re_1784690507433\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ae66c37488b1d027945da12a0424d4617a92248_re_1784690507433\" data-origin-width=\"766\" data-origin-height=\"42\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/029c11b34c4b80a09fe01aafb627c95c02a84d43_re_1784690507435\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/029c11b34c4b80a09fe01aafb627c95c02a84d43_re_1784690507435\" data-origin-width=\"654\" data-origin-height=\"58\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">8번 줄에</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">위에서 복사해둔 스프레드시트 아이디를 빈 칸에 입력해야 합니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9d5f8a4a61c06d0e09e3b046ad6a887a9dff0c20_re_1784690507435\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9d5f8a4a61c06d0e09e3b046ad6a887a9dff0c20_re_1784690507435\" data-origin-width=\"522\" data-origin-height=\"244\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">다음은 왼쪽 위의 + -&gt; HTML을 눌러줍니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f672fcf37d80260e36f0b6d19cd749ec75e04a59_re_1784690507435\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f672fcf37d80260e36f0b6d19cd749ec75e04a59_re_1784690507435\" data-origin-width=\"288\" data-origin-height=\"172\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">이름은 index라고 칩니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9342a0a8b5926bb77d2afb9414b384694567a0ed_re_1784690507436\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9342a0a8b5926bb77d2afb9414b384694567a0ed_re_1784690507436\" data-origin-width=\"943\" data-origin-height=\"403\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">아까와 같이 본문 내용은 모두 지웁니다.</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9fc240cfa6b0a61d8d4d408b54f7f209e0cd4aa4?download\" data-file-name=\"index_easy.html\" data-file-size=\"24316\" data-mimetype=\"text/html\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfOh3%26dataid%3D3%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20260722134737&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F9fc240cfa6b0a61d8d4d408b54f7f209e0cd4aa4')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">index_easy</span><span class=\"type\">.html</span></div><div class=\"size\">23.75KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">아까와 같이 해당 파일 -&gt; 메모장 편집 -&gt; 전부 복사 붙여넣기</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/615d87e64a3165178873f1d4ad461cf183653963_re_1784690507437\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/615d87e64a3165178873f1d4ad461cf183653963_re_1784690507437\" data-origin-width=\"1048\" data-origin-height=\"737\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">여기까지 한 후 Ctrl+S 로 저장해줍니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">■ 3단계: 배포하기</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c252e02f81c7182aeb5f5ec371eca68fb59085d_re_1784690507437\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c252e02f81c7182aeb5f5ec371eca68fb59085d_re_1784690507437\" data-origin-width=\"1797\" data-origin-height=\"537\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">오른쪽 위 배포 -&gt; 새 배포</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d36e82f97cc388c40cc157fe35d28bbe48cc62f4_re_1784690507437\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d36e82f97cc388c40cc157fe35d28bbe48cc62f4_re_1784690507437\" data-origin-width=\"754\" data-origin-height=\"594\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">톱니바퀴 -&gt; 웹 앱 선택</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3248c3573222aac20b41661140b382db0a3440ef_re_1784690507443\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3248c3573222aac20b41661140b382db0a3440ef_re_1784690507443\" data-origin-width=\"747\" data-origin-height=\"595\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">실행 권한은 나만</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">액세스 권한이 있는 사용자: 모든 사용자</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cbe82b4e4bcb456ecc6bca6084366024e9ba23bc_re_1784690507443\" data-origin-width=\"747\" data-origin-height=\"593\" style=\"width:61.45%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cbe82b4e4bcb456ecc6bca6084366024e9ba23bc_re_1784690507443\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/821b4f124f014d39cccccbb5f9f64e20a3ad593c_re_1784690507444\" data-origin-width=\"629\" data-origin-height=\"796\" style=\"width:38.55%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/821b4f124f014d39cccccbb5f9f64e20a3ad593c_re_1784690507444\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">액세스 승인 -&gt; Continue</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b91a7078065b3e9ccdc1e7ec11e6197236f6883f_re_1784690507445\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b91a7078065b3e9ccdc1e7ec11e6197236f6883f_re_1784690507445\" data-origin-width=\"754\" data-origin-height=\"598\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">이렇게 하면 배포할 앱스크립트가 완성됩니다!</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">이 링크를 클래스룸에 올리거나 QR코드 만들면 될 거 같습니다</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">바로 테스트를 해보았습니다</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a11a7aba6093636a6df85f624e3bceb7a4447c3_re_1784690507445\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a11a7aba6093636a6df85f624e3bceb7a4447c3_re_1784690507445\" data-origin-width=\"1874\" data-origin-height=\"982\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">정운기 선생님이 만드신 내용에서 필요한 부분만 빼왔습니다</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">링크 만들기 -&gt; 제출하기</p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d0de14017d36286cbb0d680511128900bc3017f_re_1784690507446\" data-origin-width=\"753\" data-origin-height=\"827\" style=\"width:51.62%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7d0de14017d36286cbb0d680511128900bc3017f_re_1784690507446\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f717b72f457cb64477e180933b04854ddcf0c6a6_re_1784690507446\" data-origin-width=\"722\" data-origin-height=\"846\" style=\"width:48.38%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f717b72f457cb64477e180933b04854ddcf0c6a6_re_1784690507446\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">테스트용으로 저번에 만든 중화반응 시뮬레이션을 넣어보았습니다</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">미리보기 기능까지 있는 게 대단합니다...</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/51b4f36ce6fd3a7b1bc95f573a6317ec868612ef_re_1784690507446\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/51b4f36ce6fd3a7b1bc95f573a6317ec868612ef_re_1784690507446\" data-origin-width=\"711\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">다음 페이지에 제출 내용도 채워보고</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">원본에서 추가한 것은 제출 뿐만 아니라 친구들과의 소통이 중요할 거 같아 패들렛 제출용 내용을 자동으로 만들어달라고 했습니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ab425ac8902c209ccc35e107cd848328bf10852_re_1784690507446\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ab425ac8902c209ccc35e107cd848328bf10852_re_1784690507446\" data-origin-width=\"744\" data-origin-height=\"419\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#129514;&#160;[화학&#160;평형]&#160;산염기중화반응<br>&#128100;&#160;김지희<br><br>&#128300;&#160;선택한&#160;과학&#160;원리<br>산과&#160;염기가&#160;1:1로&#160;반응해서&#160;물이&#160;돼요<br><br>&#9881;&#65039;&#160;주요&#160;기능<br>HCl이&#160;있으면&#160;NaOH를&#160;넣어요.&#160;염기가&#160;많아지면&#160;페놀프탈레인&#160;용액&#160;색변화도&#160;일어나고&#160;중화&#160;반응에&#160;따라&#160;온도도&#160;올라가요!!&#160;밑에&#160;중화&#160;곡선도&#160;있어요!!!<br><br>&#128269;&#160;R단계&#160;수정&#160;내용<br>처음에&#160;색변화가&#160;나타나지&#160;않아서&#160;고쳤어요<br><br>&#128279;&#160;시뮬레이션&#160;링크<br><a href=\"https://script.google.com/a/ai.jne.kr/macros/s/AKfycbxbFEYx32ibv3enukdmp1M4TbEH0v28zWHVzv-tXJd_tp88cZ-l7QpaKzOq98kH14fk/exec?page=view&amp;id=ab88066f\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://script.google.com/a/ai.jne.kr/macros/s/AKfycbxbFEYx32ibv3enukdmp1M4TbEH0v28zWHVzv-tXJd_tp88cZ-l7QpaKzOq98kH14fk/exec?page=view&amp;id=ab88066f</a></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">이러면 학생은 내용을 그대로 복사해서 패들렛에 올리면 됩니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f3e0c6c511203cf60b7d4d24eb162955920b464_re_1784690507446\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f3e0c6c511203cf60b7d4d24eb162955920b464_re_1784690507446\" data-origin-width=\"1168\" data-origin-height=\"105\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">시트도 확인해봤습니다</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">정말 깔끔하네요 ㅜㅜ 하 너무 고생했던 게... 이렇게 잘... 선생님 다시 한 번 감사드립니다 ㅜㅜ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6807ada0360dc0050632fd0e2e93e59b3db62cdc_re_1784690507446\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6807ada0360dc0050632fd0e2e93e59b3db62cdc_re_1784690507446\" data-origin-width=\"1243\" data-origin-height=\"863\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">학생 코드까지 확인 가능합니다</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\"><b>+)&#160; 약간의 세부 수정</b></p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">모든 과학 선생님들이 사용하길 바래서 일부러 화학이 아니라 다 과학으로 했는데요</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">단원명은 직접 수정이 필요할 거 같습니다</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/292e5c699da6c97fea5b4263032a105ef0f13622_re_1784690507446\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/292e5c699da6c97fea5b4263032a105ef0f13622_re_1784690507446\" data-origin-width=\"675\" data-origin-height=\"203\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/75aa3c628d5fc1da196a67103a3215b7cb1b5b94_re_1784690507446\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/75aa3c628d5fc1da196a67103a3215b7cb1b5b94_re_1784690507446\" data-origin-width=\"679\" data-origin-height=\"81\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">수정이 필요한 부분은 이 두 곳입니다</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">index 파일에서 수정하셔도 되고 Apps Script에서 수정하셔도 됩니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/752625bc7f87923fe02155b49d6be89fc734a891_re_1784690507447\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/752625bc7f87923fe02155b49d6be89fc734a891_re_1784690507447\" data-origin-width=\"1799\" data-origin-height=\"765\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">Ctrl+F (찾기) 이용해서 &#39;선생님&#39;만 쳐도 해당 부분이 나옵니다 ㅎㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e225446e16509271743d37e93a51ae5471364a4_re_1784690507447\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3e225446e16509271743d37e93a51ae5471364a4_re_1784690507447\" data-origin-width=\"773\" data-origin-height=\"343\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">먼저 단원명입니다</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">526~528 수정하면 됩니다</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3770e2ac3bf1c15ebb13a264f7117e4f1dfb5891_re_1784690507447\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3770e2ac3bf1c15ebb13a264f7117e4f1dfb5891_re_1784690507447\" data-origin-width=\"670\" data-origin-height=\"146\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">엔터치고 복붙해서 그대로 추가도 되네요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/60c1e0a3a3c1b4fbe492945ee45328fb8c1462d6_re_1784690507447\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/60c1e0a3a3c1b4fbe492945ee45328fb8c1462d6_re_1784690507447\" data-origin-width=\"897\" data-origin-height=\"113\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">위에서 한 줄을 추가했으니 원래는 535 였겠네요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/433a700e0c015c262018fc3d4f43e148ed876bf4_re_1784690507448\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/433a700e0c015c262018fc3d4f43e148ed876bf4_re_1784690507448\" data-origin-width=\"912\" data-origin-height=\"83\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">여기도 수정해보고 적용해보았습니다</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0cd5293b562980bb9f8308780c791384483f9869_re_1784690507448\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0cd5293b562980bb9f8308780c791384483f9869_re_1784690507448\" data-origin-width=\"678\" data-origin-height=\"246\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2fe7589e410fb2272f72cd1b9f813ac81f3e5623_re_1784690507449\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2fe7589e410fb2272f72cd1b9f813ac81f3e5623_re_1784690507449\" data-origin-width=\"672\" data-origin-height=\"87\"></div><p style=\"text-align: start;\">잘 적용되었습니다 ㅎㅎ</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">재과만의 집단지성 덕분에 가장 큰 문제를 해결한 것 같습니다</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">정운기 선생님 다시 한 번 감사드립니다</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: start;\">선생님들도 이 자료들을 토대로 한 번 시도해보셨으면 합니다</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
